    LAMBDA -->|SNS Publish| SNS_SVC
    MAINT -->|manual broadcast| SNS_INS
    MAINT -->|manual broadcast| SNS_SVC
    SNS_INS --> EMAIL
    SNS_SVC --> EMAIL

    %% ─── Secrets Sync ───────────────────────────────────────────────
    ESO -->|GetSecretValue · IRSA| SM
    ESO -->|GetParameter| SSM
    ESO -.->|sync K8s Secrets| AUTH
    ESO -.->|sync K8s Secrets| VEHICLE
    ESO -.->|sync K8s Secrets| MAINT
    ESO -.->|sync K8s Secrets| REQUEST
    LAMBDA -->|GetSecretValue| SM

    %% ─── Observability ──────────────────────────────────────────────
    FLUENT -->|log streams| CW
    SFN -->|execution logs| CW
    LAMBDA -->|function logs| CW
    CW -->|alarm triggers| SNS_SVC
    XRAY -.->|traces| LAMBDA
    XRAY -.->|traces| SFN

    %% ─── CI/CD ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    GHA -->|docker push OIDC| ECR
    GHA -->|update image tag in deploy repo| GH
    ECR -.->|pull images| EKS
    ARGOCD -->|watches git poll 3min| GH
    ARGOCD -->|kubectl apply sync waves 0-5| PROD
    GHA -->|terraform plan apply| TFSTATE
    GHA -->|state lock| DDB

    %% ─── Network ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    EKS -.->|outbound traffic| NAT

